Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.11,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:34.46,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.93,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:46.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:20.45,Episode,K,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:20.45,Title,K,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Operation Take Back Tokyo -Apocalypse-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:18.45,HybridTop,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:21.32,HybridTop,K,0000,0000,0000,,Tokyo was supposed to be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:23.46,HybridTop,K,0000,0000,0000,,How is it back to normal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:27.75,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,It's not back to normal at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:34.76,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.47,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What you saw
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:41.18,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,was an illusion created by magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:45.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,A reflection of what once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.85,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:50.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,This city is a Plant of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.54,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I've excluded only you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:56.73,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,from the effects of the magic field\Ncovering this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:03:01.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,They're seeing an illusion of peaceful days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:05.29,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That allows me to efficiently and continually
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:08.52,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,harvest their life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:13.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The field absorbs the life energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:15.92,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,turns it into magical energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.51,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and then sends it to Batlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's a small area for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:23.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,but soon it will cover all of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Then all of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:28.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And eventually the whole world\Nwill become a Plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:34.53,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell do you think\Ntheir lives are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:37.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:41.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You only see everything as a subject\Nfor your experiments!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:46.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Me, Sis, Amaterasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking you back with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.59,0:03:50.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you tell me a way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.90,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,to safely remove the Heart Hybrid Cores!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.04,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.05,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Those things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:00.32,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,are out of place artifacts \Neven in the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.19,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,I simply used the cores
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:04.75,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,to create a system that \Nwould let a normal person
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:08.22,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,produce life energy as a \Nreplacement for magical energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't make them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:13.37,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:17.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then how can they be removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:20.23,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,I just told you it was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:22.58,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone... They're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.84,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.03,0:04:34.12,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,All humans die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:51.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:01.24,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:08.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I will be your opponent now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:11.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.16,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.03,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get the people of Tokyo\Ncaught up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.18,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think I'll let you\Nget away, do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.97,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Everything's going\Naccording to plan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.71,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Let us go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.44,HybridMain,V,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Nayuta-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:47.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No—!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:01.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Come...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.58,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.82,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Come get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.33,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I'll send you all to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.63,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You look like you'll entertain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:51.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:53.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:54.71,HybridMain,All,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This is the Entrance sealing team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:09.24,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We're in the Yamanote Line area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.50,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.94,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Continue the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.21,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Magitech signals to the northeast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.00,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.35,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,They found us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.55,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, stay alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Work teams, get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.26,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll defend this place to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:39.27,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,That big one's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.67,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Those two were powerless against it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.77,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave them to Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.27,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,and buy some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:50.28,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, here we go, fatass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.65,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.04,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:12.42,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.58,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:34.89,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.43,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait! I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:43.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I wouldn't let you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:45.81,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The girl I'll take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.59,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But the rest of you are apparently useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll eliminate you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:58.63,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,If I only had...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.26,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,...strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:09.61,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.43,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I'm late, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is that your...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:55.40,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:10:01.44,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,This is my Heart Hybrid Gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:03.55,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Taros!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:05.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Taros?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:09.92,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:18.62,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:20.78,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:22.29,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But don't take any big risks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:25.69,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.33,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:30.61,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.19,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,how dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you do that to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.99,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I'll protect everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:41.08,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you lay another finger on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:54.84,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Intercept!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:09.98,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Hit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.25,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:27.00,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,...lose to someone like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.75,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Someone like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:34.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Someone like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:39.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:44.18,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I won't lose, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:48.77,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:56.02,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Begone from this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.75,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.13,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,What power...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:19.76,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That is... Taros...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.87,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:36.54,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.71,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible. Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.65,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A member of the Royal Guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.74,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,To someone like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.71,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, that can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:50.14,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather die than lose to a Lemurian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:51.66,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.18,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:55.46,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:55.92,HybridOverlap,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.07,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:13:02.47,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,For doing this to me... To {\i1}me{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,So it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.79,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:07.43,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,For your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.22,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:11.49,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Everything! Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:12.93,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll blow it all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:14.94,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:17.97,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.40,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:36.12,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.05,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The energy ball that appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:00.27,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,has a calorific value of \N7.2 exa-high-mega-joules!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:01.65,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And it's still rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:05.66,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Not only will it wipe out Tokyo,\Nit will destroy all of the Kanto region!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:08.11,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I'm blocking it with my shield,\Nbut it's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.54,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Sylvia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.43,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:11.27,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:12.41,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:15.89,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Your shields probably can't handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.91,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,But the people of Tokyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.38,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.17,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.43,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.42,sign_20706_169_Connection_Faile,,0000,0000,0000,,Connection Failed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.68,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:35.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.44,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Shield generator, full drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:44.95,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Immoral Weapon:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.57,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Titania!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.96,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Full Power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:17.73,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Ignition Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:33.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:35.31,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:37.47,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.52,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:44.19,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Did I protect everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:45.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:46.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You did great, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:55.08,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Enough power to create a black hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.83,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,That was quite the splendid sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:16:59.83,HybridMain,N,0000,0000,0000,,Let us meet again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:01.13,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.59,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.09,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,But our Counts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:13.99,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,They're coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:16.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,They won't give us a chance to resupply?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.75,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,I thought this might happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:19.63,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,so I already took measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:21.35,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:25.67,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:26.61,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:29.61,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A mid-range ballistic-type supply room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.36,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,AKA The Bullet Love Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:36.03,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Start with the ones whose \NCounts are the lowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:38.87,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,The others are to provide \Nas much support as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:40.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.63,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, we'll start with Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.81,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:46.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The others are to provide support!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.30,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.56,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Aine, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.38,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Let's clear out the small fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.68,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:18:00.89,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:05.65,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.15,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:17.20,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,They're just having a wonderful dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:17.86,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.07,0:18:21.12,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.56,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,She disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:29.13,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Lemurian,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.43,0:18:31.13,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,what is your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.70,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.57,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Not there... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.22,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:17.05,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,At a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.09,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't concentrate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.69,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Because I don't have any strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:28.60,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Fighting was all I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:30.27,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,But now I'm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:34.99,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want power so that I can stay myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.05,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:51.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:57.25,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:15.36,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You're finally out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:18.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:22.10,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Your Heart Hybrid always \Ntakes so long, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:24.54,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you were having a good time, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.40,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's crass slander!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:28.77,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I would never do something \Nas perverted as this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:31.75,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,...b-because I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:34.08,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.40,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, now that you've recharged,\Nget to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.38,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.31,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Neros!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.13,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:20:59.95,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:05.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:10.18,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,A-Aine-san? What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.07,HybridItalics,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It's supposed to be my turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.11,HybridItalics,Y,0000,0000,0000,,No fair, Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:14.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about an annoying crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:17.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:23.05,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, do it with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:27.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But your Hybrid Count is still high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:31.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,To change the course of \Nthis battle, I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:32.93,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,...the forbidden weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:33.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.92,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.53,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.57,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, that won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:42.24,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So do it with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.07,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:17.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:21.84,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take you someplace special.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:39.98,Illustration,,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Hiroyuki Yoshikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:28.27,HybridTop,Preview,0000,0000,0000,,Aine, ever since we met that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:29.89,HybridTop,Preview,0000,0000,0000,,I think I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:32.77,HybridTop,Preview,0000,0000,0000,,That I was here to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:35.39,HybridTop,Preview,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too. I was able to feel it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:39.98,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,{\fad(900,1)}Next time: Aine -Aines-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:37.19,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,...because I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:39.63,HybridTop,Preview,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not scared of anything anymore, Kizuna.
